{"id":"acf_embedding_distance","title":"Autocorrelation features embedding distance","family":"embedding","definition":"reference","intro_en":"Center each series and compare it with delayed versions of itself. Six lag coordinates summarize repeated linear dependence. This example follows EchoTime's adjusted denominator, (n-lag) times the population variance, and omits the always-one lag-zero coordinate. Euclidean distance retains differences in both vector scale and coordinates.","intro_zh":"先对序列去均值，再与自身的延迟版本比较。六个滞后坐标描述重复出现的线性依赖。本例采用 EchoTime 的调整分母，即 (n-lag) 乘总体方差，并省略恒为一的零滞后坐标。 欧氏距离同时保留向量尺度与坐标差异。","steps_en":["At each lag, sum centered lagged products and divide by (n-lag) times variance.","Collect the computed coordinates in the same fixed order for both inputs.","Take the Euclidean norm of the coordinate differences.","Interpret the score in this representation, accounting for the information it discards."],"steps_zh":["逐个滞后累加去均值后的乘积，除以 (n-lag) 乘方差。","把计算得到的坐标按同一个固定顺序组成两个向量。","对坐标差计算欧氏范数。","结合表示所舍弃的信息，在该表示空间中解释分数。"],"animation_steps_en":["Compute centered lag products at lags 1 to 6, with adjusted denominators.","Collect matching coordinates in the same vector order.","Take the Euclidean norm of coordinate differences.","Read the score in this feature space, with its stated information loss."],"formula":"d(x,y) = sqrt(sum_j (phi_j(x)-phi_j(y))^2)","caveats_en":["Adjusted high-lag sample estimates need not remain inside [-1,1]; estimates are less reliable with fewer overlapping pairs.","ACF drops the mean and amplitude scale and cannot fully identify nonlinear dependence or the original waveform.","A metric on these feature vectors can be only a pseudometric on the original series when the representation loses information."],"caveats_zh":["经过样本数调整的高滞后估计不一定落在 [-1,1]，重叠点越少估计越不稳定。","ACF 舍弃均值和振幅尺度，无法完整识别非线性依赖或恢复原波形。","当表示损失信息时，特征空间中的度量在原序列空间上可能只是伪度量。"],"sources":[{"label":"EchoTime low-level implementation","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/similarity_methods.py"},{"label":"statsmodels: ACF denominator and adjusted convention","url":"https://www.statsmodels.org/stable/generated/statsmodels.tsa.stattools.acf.html"},{"label":"Exact illustrative inputs and encoder definitions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/tools/method_animation_data/feature_model_embedding.py"}],"x":[0.0,0.8769216919004693,0.8094744111674236,0.7863961030678929,0.3905255888325767,-0.5769216919004693,-0.6000000000000001,-0.09587051423531628,0.2094744111674235,1.0863961030678926,1.5905255888325764,0.9958705142353173,0.6000000000000002,0.20412948576468337,-0.39052558883257615,0.11360389693210537],"y":[-0.2003300858899106,0.185,0.5703300858899106,1.005,1.0003300858899107,0.3250000000000002,-0.35033008588991066,-0.3550000000000001,0.07966991411008931,0.46499999999999997,0.8503300858899105,1.2849999999999995,1.2803300858899114,0.6050000000000002,-0.07033008588991083,-0.07500000000000043],"input_label":"Deterministic synthetic teaching signals, 16 samples each","parameters":{"max_lag":6,"denominator":"(n-lag)*population_variance","lag_zero":"omitted","comparison":"euclidean"},"result":{"label":"distance","value":0.3688041301851493,"detail":"Computed from the explicitly defined illustrative encoder; no learned weights."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Lag 1: sum centered products, then divide by (n-lag) times variance.","panel":{"kind":"lines","title":"Lag-1 centered products","a":[-0.18822063446267598,0.2180721315406135,0.17874107963699554,0.006387166743556502,-0.014779144789257556,0.9281236496029575,0.45909875137943323,0.07794111913269876,-0.11775425885351315,0.8647201670748005,0.7546839974046686,0.1396958657029466,-0.038445865702946266,0.13080575102411574,0.20010540571959068],"a_label":"x products","b":[0.13941884453995465,-0.03590634453995467,0.09351432588977204,0.348289325889772,-0.05143513251536707,0.06674763251536703,0.5854720909205064,0.2554470909205065,-0.017473579509220308,0.0229860795092203,0.3820067